title: Dashboard › Request drawer › Check now, Open case and closing
route: /dashboard?request=R-1021
intro: The footer of the drawer holds up to three buttons, and the drawer can be closed four ways. 'Check now' only fakes a payer check in the demo; it never moves a request to another stage.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Request drawer is open"
decision d1 "Is the stage Preparing? (not sent yet)"
screen f1 "Footer: 'Open case' only\nNo 'Check now' because nothing has been sent"
screen f2 "Footer: 'Check now' (green), 'Open case'"
decision d2 "Is it a denial? (ID starts with D-)"
screen f3 "Footer also has 'Open in Denial Intelligence'"

click c1 "Click 'Check now'"
process p1 "Button shows a spinner for 1.2 seconds"
agent a1 "Navigator checks the payer (demo: simulated)"
store w1 "History gets 'Navigator checked: under review'\nThe chip text in lower case"
decision d3 "Is the stage Received or Under review?"
store w2 "What happens next becomes 'Navigator checks again in 30 minutes'"
toast t1 "'Navigator checked'\n'R-1021 is still under review at Cardinal. It checks again in 30 minutes.'"
end e1 "Drawer stays open\nNo stage changes"

click c2 "Click 'Open case'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page\n/authorizations/case/ followed by the case ID"
click c3 "Click 'Open in Denial Intelligence'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials\n/denials?id=D-3318"

group gClose "Closing the drawer"
  click x1 "Click the X 'Close'"
  click x2 "Press Escape"
  click x3 "Click the dimmed page outside the drawer"
  click x4 "Browser Back (when a click opened it)"
endgroup
process p2 "?request is removed from the address\nFilters and paging stay as they were"
end e2 "Drawer closed, table as before"
process p3 "Escape closes one layer at a time\nA pop-up opened from the drawer closes first; the next Escape closes the drawer"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| f1
d1 -->|No| f2
f1 --> d2
f2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| f3
d2 -->|No| c2
f3 --> c3 --> g2
f3 --> c2
f2 --> c1 --> p1 --> a1 --> w1 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| w2 --> t1
d3 -->|No| t1
t1 --> e1
c2 --> g1
f1 --> c2
s1 --> x1 & x2 & x3 & x4
x1 & x2 & x3 & x4 --> p2 --> e2
x2 -.-> p3
